  "findings": [
    "Five production files implement one editing geometry resolver, unsupported-entry reason, shared-content commit, and all authoring entry points. Runtime/renderers and native readers are unchanged.",
    "Dedicated command preserves every source property except the target type/path. Derived ordinary adaptive geometry is shared deliberately; temporary state previews do not enter it.",
    "Point entry/no-op/cancel are independent transaction policies; CIL evidence does not substitute for native GUI gesture observation.",
    "First browser integration failures were floating-point-only oracles; retained red reports show observed values. Tests now compare every expected numeric coordinate with 1e-12 precision while other saved fields remain exact.",
    "Old artifact bytes and evidence are preserved; the executable package tested is the package prepared for publication."
  ],
